sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student portal
    participant D as MySQL
    participant A as Admin portal
    S->>D: Insert Pending request and commit
    A->>D: Query pending requests
    D-->>A: Requests with student names
    A->>D: Find request by ID
    A->>D: Set Approved or Rejected and commit
    S->>D: Query history for signed-in student
    D-->>S: Updated request status
